ALGORITHM ParseXMLDocument

START

1. Specify the XML file name.

2. Load the XML document into an XML parser.

3. IF the XML file cannot be loaded THEN
       Display "Error: XML file not found"
       STOP
   END IF

4. Validate whether the XML document is well-formed.

5. IF XML is invalid THEN
       Display "Error: Invalid XML document"
       STOP
   END IF

6. Access the root element of the XML document.

7. Find all required parent elements such as "products".

8. FOR each product node in the XML document DO

       Access the product ID.

       Access the product name.

       Access the product price.

       Access the product quantity.

       Display:
           Product ID
           Product Name
           Price
           Quantity

       IF the product contains child elements THEN
           Traverse the child elements.
           Extract their values.
       END IF

   END FOR

9. IF no product nodes are found THEN
       Display "No product data available"
   END IF

10. Close the XML parser.

11. Display "XML processing completed."

END
